.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113060","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113060.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113060.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-13T16:47:46Z"},"body":"Clean up Find in Files code\r\nChanges variable names to not use underscore prefix, parameters to use appropriate `p_` / `r_` prefixes, signals to strings instead of variables for the name, reorders private/public member order in header, to match our usual style.\r\nAlso some minor other changes: The `_mode` variable in FindInFilesDialog and the `FindInFilesMode` enum is removed in favor of a bool `replace_mode`. `vformat` is used instead of `String.format`. Removed the string array being passed to `files_modified` signal, its unused.\r\n\r\nMoves Find in Files setup out of ScriptEditor since it is unrelated to ScriptEditor. Adds a new FindInFiles class for this (the other one is renamed FindInFilesSearch to be more clear). Maybe this could become a singleton or its own plugin in the future?\r\nThis does create more signal forwarding, but I want to further clean up signals in the future, many of them can be removed. \r\n\r\n~Note, the error `ERROR: Child is not a child of this node.` when starting a search is unrelated, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113024~","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_